  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "这是一座“会下跪让对手大意，\n再用头上的刀劈向对手的宝可梦”的雕像。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n感觉是纯金做的？总之肯定是贵重物品，\n还是不要碰比较好……",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 156,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD9662F4E005EA7201C4F1A4E0B8DEA8BA95BF9624B5927610FFF0C000A518D752859344E0A76845200528854115BF9624B76845B9D53EF68A6201D768496D550CF300200100001BE01000A611F89C9662F7EAF91D1505A7684FF1F603B4E4B80AF5B9A662F8D3591CD726954C1FF0C000A8FD8662F4E0D898178B06BD48F83597D202620260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 68
    },
    {
      "displayText": "陈列着莫名让人觉得\n很厉害的扇子等物品。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n这些东西散发着价格不菲的气息，\n还是不要碰比较好……",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 292,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "96485217774083AB540D8BA94EBA89C95F97000A5F8853895BB3768462475B507B49726954C1300200100001BE01000A8FD94E9B4E1C897F656353D177404EF7683C4E0D83F276846C14606FFF0C000A8FD8662F4E0D898178B06BD48F83597D202620260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 51
    },
    {
      "displayText": "装饰着某种挂轴和\n不太了解的罐子的收藏品？<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n虽然不了解它们的价值，但感觉好像很贵，\n还是不要碰比较好……",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 396,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "88C59970774067D079CD63028F74548C000A4E0D592A4E8689E376847F505B507684653685CF54C1FF1F00100001BE01000A867D71364E0D4E8689E35B834EEC76844EF7503CFF0C4F46611F89C9597D50CF5F888D35FF0C000A8FD8662F4E0D898178B06BD48F83597D202620260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 56
    },
    {
      "displayText": "装饰着某种挂轴和\n铜镜怪造型的青铜镜子。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n虽然不了解它们的价值，但感觉好像很贵，\n还是不要碰比较好……",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 508,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "88C59970774067D079CD63028F74548C000A94DC955C602A9020578B7684975294DC955C5B50300200100001BE01000A867D71364E0D4E8689E35B834EEC76844EF7503CFF0C4F46611F89C9597D50CF5F888D35FF0C000A8FD8662F4E0D898178B06BD48F83597D202620260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 55
    },
    {
      "displayText": "装饰着某种挂轴和\n招财狃拉。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n虽然不了解它们的价值，但感觉好像很贵，\n还是不要碰比较好……",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 620,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "88C59970774067D079CD63028F74548C000A62DB8D2272C362C9300200100001BE01000A867D71364E0D4E8689E35B834EEC76844EF7503CFF0C4F46611F89C9597D50CF5F888D35FF0C000A8FD8662F4E0D898178B06BD48F83597D202620260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "装饰着某种挂轴和\n在某种竞技中使用的棋子。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n虽然不了解它们的价值，但感觉好像很贵，\n还是不要碰比较好……",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 720,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "88C59970774067D079CD63028F74548C000A572867D079CD7ADE62804E2D4F7F7528768468CB5B50300200100001BE01000A867D71364E0D4E8689E35B834EEC76844EF7503CFF0C4F46611F89C9597D50CF5F888D35FF0C000A8FD8662F4E0D898178B06BD48F83597D202620260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 56
    },
    {
      "displayText": "模仿别名为海鬼的宝可梦\n制作而成的罐子。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n看起来像是贵重物品，\n还是不要碰比较好……",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 832,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6A214EFF522B540D4E3A6D779B3C76845B9D53EF68A6000A52364F5C800C621076847F505B50300200100001BE01000A770B8D77676550CF662F8D3591CD726954C1FF0C000A8FD8662F4E0D898178B06BD48F83597D202620260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "放着一把不知道\n是不是真货的……刀？<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n应该是比较危险的东西，\n还是不要碰比较好……",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 924,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "653E77404E00628A4E0D77E59053000A662F4E0D662F771F8D277684202620265200FF1F00100001BE01000A5E948BE5662F6BD48F835371966976844E1C897FFF0C000A8FD8662F4E0D898178B06BD48F83597D202620260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我决不会输！\n有的事必须得按照我的方式来做。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1016,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621151B34E0D4F1A8F93FF01000A670976844E8B5FC5987B5F97630971676211768465B95F0F6765505A300200100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "别一直在这里瞎晃悠。\n要是闲着没事干，我就给你派点活。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1072,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "522B4E0076F457288FD991CC778E664360A03002000A8981662F95F277406CA14E8B5E72FF0C62115C317ED94F606D3E70B96D3B300200100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "要是不把塔的事解决了，\n大家心里肯定都不安生！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1136,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8981662F4E0D628A585476844E8B89E351B34E86FF0C000A59275BB65FC391CC80AF5B9A90FD4E0D5B89751FFF0100100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "咱们来搞个类似锈蚀组vs超Z队\n这种形式的组织对抗赛如何？<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n这不比由紫的企画有意思多了？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1192,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54B14EEC6765641E4E2A7C7B4F3C950886807EC4007600738D85005A961F000A8FD979CD5F625F0F76847EC47EC75BF962978D5B59824F55FF1F00100001BE00000A8FD94E0D6BD475317D2B76844F01753B6709610F601D591A4E86FF1F00100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 52
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你今后也别忘了要继续完成\n异次元课题的调查啊。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n等到攒够了调查点数，\n就去和吉普索说一声吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1296,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F604ECA540E4E5F522B5FD84E8689817EE77EED5B8C6210000A5F026B2151438BFE989876848C0367E5554A300200100001BE01000A7B4952306512591F4E868C0367E570B96570FF0C000A5C3153BB548C5409666E7D228BF44E0058F05427300200100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 54
    },
    {
      "displayText": "如果存在奇怪的规则，\n就说明有人在从中获利，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n就像锈蚀组的利息一样。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1404,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5982679C5B5857285947602A768489C45219FF0C000A5C318BF4660E67094EBA57284ECE4E2D83B75229FF0C00100001BE00000A5C3150CF950886807EC476845229606F4E006837300200100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "请帮我转告<U+0010><U+0002>Ƌ<U+0001>，\n我很期待<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā她他的新视频。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1488,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8BF75E2E62118F6C544A00100002018B0001FF0C000A62115F88671F5F8500100003110000FF010159794ED6768465B089C69891300200100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "密阿雷的象征出现了异常啊。\n这就是所谓的发生坏事的前兆吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1552,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5BC6963F96F776848C615F8151FA73B04E865F025E38554A3002000A8FD95C31662F62408C13768453D1751F574F4E8B7684524D51465427300200100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "只要您一来，\n不知为何老大就会变得心情很好。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1620,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53EA898160A84E006765FF0C000A4E0D77E54E3A4F55800159275C314F1A53D85F975FC360C55F88597D300200100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "全息上显示着\n出现在密阿雷市的异次元扭洞<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n和与其相关的各种数值。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1676,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5168606F4E0A663E793A7740000A51FA73B057285BC6963F96F75E0276845F026B215143626D6D1E00100001BE00000A548C4E0E517676F851737684540479CD6570503C30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "希望我们今后也能保持\n不远不近的关系。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
